Yes! And as an additional bonus for the talent premium goods full set,

656
00:49:31,272 --> 00:49:38,872
昨年から発売された「hololive OFFICIAL CARD GAME」で使用できるカードが1枚付きます！
a card that can be used in the 'hololive OFFICIAL CARD GAME' released last year is included!

657
00:49:39,072 --> 00:49:45,072
カードはホロライブプロダクションオフィシャルショップで購入された方のみ対象となります。
This card applies only to those who purchase from the Hololive Production Official Shop.

658
00:49:45,572 --> 00:49:51,572
特典につくのは推しをアピールできるキーカード、推しホロメンカードでございます。
The bonus is an Oshi Holomen card, a key card to showcase your favorite talent!

659
00:49:52,072 --> 00:49:57,072
カードの詳細や遊び方についてはホームページをご確認ください。
For card details and how to play, please check the official website.

660
00:49:57,272 --> 00:50:00,072
同梱するカードは日本語版のみとなります。
Please note that the included card is available in Japanese only.

661
00:50:00,080 --> 00:50:02,380
ますので ご了承ください
So please keep that in mind!

662
00:50:03,080 --> 00:50:08,380
以上 AZKi誕生日記念2025のグッズ情報でした
That was the goods information for AZKi Birthday Commemoration 2025!

663
00:50:08,580 --> 00:50:11,280
みんな買ってね ぜひ
Everyone, please buy them! Be sure to!

664
00:50:11,580 --> 00:50:13,980
よろしくお願いします
Thank you so much!

665
00:50:14,280 --> 00:50:18,080
ということで お待たせいたしました
And with that, thank you for waiting!

666
00:50:18,380 --> 00:50:22,080
さらに重大発表ございます
Furthermore, we have a major announcement!

667
00:50:22,380 --> 00:50:24,580
それではお待たせいたしました
So, thank you for waiting.

668
00:50:24,880 --> 00:50:27,080
こちらをご覧ください
Please take a look at this!

669
00:50:28,080 --> 00:50:31,080
重大発表
[Major Announcement]

670
00:50:52,580 --> 00:50:53,880
はい
Yes!

671
00:50:54,080 --> 00:50:58,280
ということで AZKiの新しいEP『Re://Start』と『Re://Birth』が
So, AZKi's new EPs, "Re://Start" and "Re://Birth",

672
00:50:58,380 --> 00:51:02,880
11月5日にリリースすることが決定いたしました！
are set to be released on November 5th!

673
00:51:04,580 --> 00:51:09,980
今回は初めてとなる2作同時リリースとなっております
This time, for the first time, it's a simultaneous release of two works!

674
00:51:10,580 --> 00:51:14,880
この後21時より hololive production OFFICIAL SHOPと
Pre-orders will start today from 21:00 on the hololive production OFFICIAL SHOP

675
00:51:14,980 --> 00:51:19,080
全国のCDショップで予約が開始されます！
and CD shops nationwide!

676
00:51:20,080 --> 00:51:23,780
そして1枚目の『Re://Start』には
And the first disc, "Re://Start", contains

677
00:51:23,880 --> 00:51:28,080
AZKiの新しい魅力が詰まった新曲4曲
four new songs filled with AZKi's new charm!

678
00:51:28,280 --> 00:51:31,580
2枚目の『Re://Birth』には
The second disc, "Re://Birth", features

679
00:51:31,680 --> 00:51:35,280
イノナカミュージック時代の楽曲4曲のリアレンジバージョンが収録されます
re-arranged versions of four songs from her INONAKA MUSIC era!

680
00:51:35,880 --> 00:51:39,880
そしてCD限定特典として それぞれボーナストラックに
And as a CD-exclusive bonus, each disc includes a bonus track,

681
00:51:39,980 --> 00:51:45,080
すいちゃんと歌った『The Last Frontier』が1種類ずつ収録されます
a different version of "The Last Frontier" sung with Sui-chan!

682
00:51:45,580 --> 00:51:52,580
また 通常版には限定特典として ランダムアナザージャケットが1枚ついてきます
Also, the regular edition comes with a random alternative jacket cover as an exclusive bonus!

683
00:51:52,880 --> 00:51:59,580
なんとこちらには数量限定で 私の直筆サイン入りが入っているかもとのことです
And apparently, a limited quantity of these might even include my handwritten signature!

684
00:52:00,080 --> 00:52:05,080
各種CDショップでの購入特典はこちらです
Here are the purchase bonuses for various CD shops!

685
00:52:05,880 --> 00:52:09,580
特典の絵柄は後日発表します
The artwork for the bonuses will be announced at a later date!

686
00:52:10,080 --> 00:52:13,980
さらに hololive production OFFICIAL SHOPでは
Furthermore, on the hololive production OFFICIAL SHOP,

687
00:52:14,080 --> 00:52:17,880
セットになったコンプリート盤を発売します
we will be releasing a complete box set!

688
00:52:18,580 --> 00:52:25,080
コンプリート盤にはここでしか手に入らない たくさんの特典もついております
The complete set comes with many exclusive bonuses that you can only get here!

689
00:52:25,280 --> 00:52:29,880
数に限りがございますので お早めに
Quantities are limited, so please order early!

690
00:52:30,080 --> 00:52:32,080
そして1点
And one more point!

691
00:52:32,180 --> 00:52:37,580
hololive production OFFICIAL SHOPのアルバム購入について注意事項がございます
There is an important notice regarding album purchases on the hololive production OFFICIAL SHOP.

692
00:52:38,080 --> 00:52:43,280
完全生産限定コンプリート盤は 発売日でのお届けとなりますので
Since the Limited Complete Edition will be delivered on the release date,

693
00:52:43,380 --> 00:52:48,880
EP以外のグッズとの商品は同時購入できません
it cannot be purchased together with non-EP merchandise!

694
00:52:49,080 --> 00:52:53,080
通常版は他のグッズとの同時購入が可能ですが
The regular edition can be purchased alongside other merchandise,

695
00:52:53,180 --> 00:52:59,880
店頭販売日以降のお届けになる可能性があるので こちらご注意ください
but please note that delivery may be after the store release date!

696
00:53:00,080 --> 00:53:05,080
詳しくは販売サイトの注意事項をご確認ください
Please check the notes on the store page for details!

697
00:53:06,080 --> 00:53:10,080
はい そして最後に もう一つお知らせあります
Yes! And finally, I have one more announcement!

698
00:53:10,580 --> 00:53:15,080
今回発表したこのニューEP『Re://Start』の中から
From the new EP "Re://Start" announced today,

699
00:53:15,180 --> 00:53:18,880
『未来カンパネラ』という楽曲を
the song titled "Mirai Campanella"

700
00:53:18,980 --> 00:53:24,080
本日24時にデジタルリリースします！
will be digitally released at midnight tonight!

701
00:53:24,580 --> 00:53:27,580
わー！新曲だー！
Yay! A new song!

702
00:53:28,080 --> 00:53:33,580
配信終了後にはミュージックビデオもプレミア公開しちゃいます！ということで
After the stream ends, the music video will also premiere! So...

703
00:53:33,680 --> 00:53:37,580
ぜひチェックしてください！
be sure to check it out!

704
00:53:38,080 --> 00:53:43,080
いっぱい情報がありましたが みんなついてこられましたか？
That was a lot of information, was everyone able to keep up?

705
00:53:43,580 --> 00:53:45,080
はい
Alright!

706
00:53:45,180 --> 00:53:50,580
ということで ライブも次の曲で最後になります
So, with that, the concert will come to an end with the next song.

707
00:53:51,080 --> 00:53:59,080
最後はAZKiの新しい曲を聴いていただきたいと思います
For the final song, I would like you to listen to AZKi's new song!

708
00:53:59,580 --> 00:54:01,880
それでは
And now,

709
00:54:02,080 --> 00:54:06,580
聴いてください 『未来カンパネラ』
please listen to "Mirai Campanella".

710
00:54:09,580 --> 00:54:14,580
もっと
More...

711
00:54:15,080 --> 00:54:19,580
もっと
More...

712
00:54:20,080 --> 00:54:25,080
もっと
More...

713
00:54:25,580 --> 00:54:30,880
もっと
More...

714
00:54:31,080 --> 00:54:33,880
鏡よ 教えて
Mirror, tell me,

715
00:54:33,980 --> 00:54:38,580
私の証は どこにあるのだろう
where is the proof of my existence?

716
00:54:38,680 --> 00:54:42,080
分から無い 分から無いよ
I don't know, I just don't know.

717
00:54:42,280 --> 00:54:44,880
周りと 比べたってさ
Even if I compare myself to others,

718
00:54:44,980 --> 00:54:47,880
虚しく なるだけ
it only leaves me feeling empty.

719
00:54:48,080 --> 00:54:53,080
あぁ ノイズが 海鳴りの ように ナミダを 奪う
Ah, the noise strips away my tears like the roaring sea.

720
00:54:53,280 --> 00:54:57,880
切り取った 風景を 道しるべに しよう
Let's turn this captured scenery into a guidepost.

721
00:54:58,080 --> 00:55:01,080
そうだ 傷ついた 感情も
That's right, even these hurt feelings...

722
00:55:00,088 --> 00:55:03,588
連れて行くから
I'll take you with me,

723
00:55:03,588 --> 00:55:08,288
そっと響くカンパネラ 新しい未来を感じてる
The softly echoing Campanella, I feel a new future.

724
00:55:08,288 --> 00:55:13,288
怖くたって進むしかないでしょ?
Even if I'm scared, I have to keep moving forward, right?

725
00:55:13,288 --> 00:55:15,888
遠くまで
Far away...

726
00:55:15,888 --> 00:55:20,088
届け この祈りよ 光となれ
Reach out, my prayer, become the light!

727
00:55:20,088 --> 00:55:27,288
もっと もっと 少しずつでもいい 「私」という答えを
More, more, even little by little is okay, the answer that is "me"...

728
00:55:27,288 --> 00:55:35,888
もっと もっと...
More, more...

729
00:55:38,088 --> 00:55:46,088
夜空よ教えて 私の証は 輝けるのかな
Tell me, night sky, will my proof shine?

730
00:55:46,088 --> 00:55:49,088
見つけたい 見つけたいよ
I want to find it, I really want to find it!

731
00:55:49,088 --> 00:55:54,088
誰かの決めたレールは 苦しくなるだけ
Walking on the rails set by someone else only brings pain.

732
00:55:54,088 --> 00:55:58,288
ねぇ ノイズも力に変えるよ
Hey, I'll turn even the noise into strength!

733
00:55:58,288 --> 00:56:00,088
ココロに誓う
I swear to my heart,

734
00:56:00,088 --> 00:56:04,288
錆びついた運命の歯車を回そう
let me turn the rusted gears of fate.

735
00:56:04,288 --> 00:56:09,888
ほら 着飾った感情は 脱ぎ捨てるから
See, I'll strip away these embellished feelings.

736
00:56:09,888 --> 00:56:15,088
そっと紡ぐシンフォニア 叶えたい願いを信じてる
Softly weaving a Symphonia, I believe in the wish I want to fulfill.

737
00:56:15,088 --> 00:56:20,088
胸を張って歌うしかないでしょ?
Hold your head high, I have no choice but to sing, right?

738
00:56:20,088 --> 00:56:22,588
全力で
With all my heart!

739
00:56:22,588 --> 00:56:26,588
やがて希望の歌に変わる日まで
Until the day it turns into a song of hope,

740
00:56:26,588 --> 00:56:34,088
もっと もっと 悩みながらでいい すべてが宝物
more, more, it's okay to struggle, everything is a treasure.

741
00:56:41,888 --> 00:56:47,088
いつの日かこの声を 受け取ってくれたなら
If someday you accept this voice of mine,

742
00:56:47,088 --> 00:56:52,088
この言葉を君に 「もう大丈夫 一人じゃない」
I'll pass these words to you: "It's alright now, you're not alone."

743
00:56:52,088 --> 00:56:56,888
強い想いを繋ぐよ
I will connect these strong feelings.

744
00:56:56,888 --> 00:57:01,888
一歩踏み出してみた 優しく世界は微笑む
I took a step forward, and the world smiled gently.

745
00:57:01,888 --> 00:57:06,588
高鳴る気持ちに身を任せて さあ行こう
Surrendering myself to these throbbing feelings, come, let's go!

746
00:57:06,588 --> 00:57:12,588
そっと響くカンパネラ 新しい未来を感じてる
The softly echoing Campanella, I feel a new future.

747
00:57:12,588 --> 00:57:17,588
怖くたって進むしかないでしょ?
Even if I'm scared, I have to keep moving forward, right?

748
00:57:17,588 --> 00:57:20,088
遠くまで
Far away...

749
00:57:20,088 --> 00:57:24,288
届け この祈りよ 光となれ
Reach out, my prayer, become the light!

750
00:57:24,288 --> 00:57:31,288
もっと もっと 少しずつでもいい 「私」という答えを
More, more, even little by little is okay, the answer that is "me"...

751
00:57:31,288 --> 00:57:39,888
もっと もっと...
More, more...

752
00:58:08,088 --> 00:58:10,588
ごめん、待った？
Sorry, did you wait long?

753
00:58:13,288 --> 00:58:18,088
ごめんね、ライブ終わった後、マネージャーさんに呼ばれちゃって。
Sorry! After the concert, my manager called me over.

754
00:58:18,088 --> 00:58:23,088
もちろん、打ち上げもあったけど、君と会うためにキャンセルしたんだからね。
Of course, there was an after-party, but I canceled it to see you!

755
00:58:26,588 --> 00:58:31,088
改めて、今日はライブに来てくれてありがとう。
Once again, thank you for coming to my concert today!

756
00:58:31,088 --> 00:58:34,888
アリーナ席の右の方にいたよね？
You were on the right side of the arena seats, right?

757
00:58:34,888 --> 00:58:37,088
ちゃんと見つけたよ！
I totally spotted you!

758
00:58:41,288 --> 00:58:44,288
実は今日、花火大会なんだって。
Actually, I heard there's a fireworks festival today.

759
00:58:44,288 --> 00:58:48,588
こんな大都会で花火あがるの、ロマンチックだなあ。
Fireworks going off in a big city like this is so romantic.

760
00:58:53,588 --> 00:58:58,288
ね、見て見て！今日のライブのキービジュアルだよ！
Hey, look, look! It's the key visual from today's concert!

761
00:58:58,288 --> 00:59:02,088
もしかしたら、ここでも流れてたのかな？
I wonder if it was playing here too?

762
00:59:02,088 --> 00:59:06,588
ついさっきのことだから、ちょっと恥ずかしいよ。
Since it was just a moment ago, it's a bit embarrassing.

763
00:59:06,588 --> 00:59:10,088
でも、とっても楽しかったな。
But it was so much fun!

764
00:59:13,588 --> 00:59:15,588
あ、雨？
Ah, rain?

765
00:59:16,088 --> 00:59:20,088
どうしよう、私、傘持ってないよ。
What should I do? I don't have an umbrella.

766
00:59:23,088 --> 00:59:26,088
あ、傘持ってきたんだ。
Ah, you brought an umbrella for me!

767
00:59:26,088 --> 00:59:30,088
ありがとう。かっこいいじゃん。
Thank you! That's so cool of you.

768
00:59:34,088 --> 00:59:42,588
でも、傘ひとつしか無いってことは...これって相合い傘だよね？
But... since there's only one umbrella... that means we're sharing an umbrella, right?

769
00:59:51,088 --> 00:59:57,088
私、相合い傘って初めてで...これってさ...
This is my first time sharing an umbrella... So this means...

770
01:00:00,096 --> 01:00:02,196
あ、ドキドキするね
Ah, my heart is pounding.

771
01:00:11,396 --> 01:00:13,096
あ、雨が止んだ
Ah, the rain stopped.

772
01:00:13,896 --> 01:00:16,196
通り雨だったのかな？
Was it a passing shower?

773
01:00:20,096 --> 01:00:25,596
なんか... 雨止んで嬉しいような... 悲しいような...
Somehow... I'm glad it stopped, but also a bit sad...

774
01:00:26,196 --> 01:00:29,896
もっと君と相合傘したかったな...
I wanted to share an umbrella with you longer...

775
01:00:30,196 --> 01:00:31,596
なんてね
Just kidding!

776
01:00:33,296 --> 01:00:37,096
雨も止んだし、雨で人通りも少なくなったしさ
Since the rain stopped and there aren't many people around,

777
01:00:37,296 --> 01:00:39,396
グリコゲームでもしようよ
let's play the Glico game!

778
01:00:39,896 --> 01:00:41,596
ここからスタートね
We'll start from here, okay?

779
01:00:42,096 --> 01:00:42,996
行くよ！
Here we go!

780
01:00:43,096 --> 01:00:45,396
じゃん・けん・ぽん！
Rock, paper, scissors!

781
01:00:46,396 --> 01:00:48,896
やったー！私の勝ち！
Yay! I won!

782
01:00:48,896 --> 01:00:53,696
ち・よ・こ・れ・い・と！
Ch-o-co-la-te!

783
01:00:57,296 --> 01:01:00,696
ちょっと何？ニヤニヤして見てるの？
Wait, what? Why are you smirking at me?

784
01:01:01,096 --> 01:01:04,096
え？可愛いって？
Huh? "You're cute"?

785
01:01:04,296 --> 01:01:08,096
もう... ちょっと恥ずかしいからやめてよ！
Geez... Stop it, you're making me embarrassed!

786
01:01:09,196 --> 01:01:10,096
次行くよ！
Next round!

787
01:01:10,196 --> 01:01:12,796
じゃん・けん・ぽん！
Rock, paper, scissors!

788
01:01:14,296 --> 01:01:17,396
ぐ・り・こ！
Gu-ri-co!

789
01:01:20,196 --> 01:01:24,096
だからちょっとニヤニヤやめてってばー！
I told you, stop smirking like that!

790
01:01:24,396 --> 01:01:25,596
次行くよ！
Next round!

791
01:01:25,896 --> 01:01:28,496
じゃん・けん・ぽん！
Rock, paper, scissors!

792
01:01:29,696 --> 01:01:33,896
ぱ・い・な・つ・ぷ・る！
Pa-i-na-pp-le!

793
01:01:34,096 --> 01:01:36,896
もう、じゃんけん弱すぎだよ〜！
Geez, you're way too weak at rock-paper-scissors~!

794
01:01:37,096 --> 01:01:40,196
絶対わざと負けてるでしょ！
You're definitely losing on purpose, right?

795
01:01:42,196 --> 01:01:45,096
もう、いい加減にしてよね！
Come on, take it seriously!

796
01:01:46,896 --> 01:01:48,896
え？何？
Huh? What?

797
01:01:49,096 --> 01:01:50,896
こっち来てって？
"Come over here"?

798
01:01:51,096 --> 01:01:52,596
どこ行くの？
Where are we going?

799
01:01:53,096 --> 01:01:56,596
何々？見せたいものがある？
What is it? You have something to show me?

800
01:01:57,196 --> 01:01:59,296
あのモニターを見ろって？
"Look at that monitor"?

801
01:02:02,096 --> 01:02:05,196
3、2、1...？
3, 2, 1...?

802
01:02:07,196 --> 01:02:09,196
え？え？どういうこと？
Eh? Eh? What does this mean?

803
01:02:09,396 --> 01:02:11,396
お誕生日おめでとう？
Happy Birthday?

804
01:02:11,896 --> 01:02:14,196
えー！ありがとうー！
Whaat! Thank you so much!

805
01:02:15,096 --> 01:02:17,396
サプライズしてくれたんだ！
You prepared a surprise for me!

806
01:02:17,496 --> 01:02:18,896
嬉しい！
I'm so happy!

807
01:02:19,596 --> 01:02:24,096
いつも一番近くで応援してくれて、本当にありがとう！
Thank you so much for always supporting me up close!

808
01:02:25,096 --> 01:02:27,596
これからもよろしくね！
Please keep supporting me from now on too!

809
01:02:29,296 --> 01:02:31,096
綺麗〜！
So pretty~!

810
01:02:32,896 --> 01:02:36,596
素敵な誕生日にしてくれてありがとう！
Thank you for making this such a wonderful birthday!

811
01:02:37,096 --> 01:02:38,296
お礼に
As a thank you,

812
01:02:38,396 --> 01:02:43,096
この後、君だけのアンコールライブするね！
I'll do an encore live just for you after this!

813
01:02:44,096 --> 01:02:48,896
これからもずっと一緒にいてね！
Please stay with me forever from now on too!

814
01:02:52,096 --> 01:04:44,596
今日はお誕生日お祝いしてくれてありがとう！新衣装のAZKiもよろしくね！！
[Text: Thank you for celebrating my birthday today! Please support AZKi in her new outfit too!!]

815
01:04:45,096 --> 01:05:00,096
新衣装お披露目 & 重大発表あり AZKi 7th Birthday Live Sweet POP Story
[Title: New Outfit Reveal & Major Announcement - AZKi 7th Birthday Live Sweet POP Story]

